{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fate has brought Dan to a town buried in the sands of the Old West. This place already has a different kind of life\u2014it's a life of crime, smuggling, and bootlegging. In the midst of the conflict between local gangs, Dan seems like someone who could solve long-standing problems. After all, he is the one who solves them with extreme violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/CAR_DESERT_3-N2.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the viscous sands of narrative and gameplay unraveling a tangle of interconnected events that will take you to a very different place than you expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tough top-down shooter inspired by Hotline Miami.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/paths_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_1.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" />Large levels with tactical freedom and adrenaline-pumping encounters. From luxury hotel penthouses to ancient temples. Everywhere you'll be challenged and you'll be sure to return the favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_2.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, hide, think. Die and think. And so every time on the way to your goal.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_3.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/NARRATIVE_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This linear story may not be at all what it seems, depending on the depth you choose. Discover another side of the events that took place and shift your focus from a hardcore gangster thriller to something more special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/MESSENGER.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Large scale levels in individual locations, hand-designed without the use of neural networks and procedural generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Truly different weapons for your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Wild West town to explore, full of stories and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original rhythmic electronic soundtrack created by the composer.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474390?t=1747587414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/4a4b4e699aed1bd3e65356dcdaf7bb6169407fad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747587414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/172bac52bc375bf61232bbbb567ea964ea8b8d9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747587414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/172bac52bc375bf61232bbbb567ea964ea8b8d9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747587414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, Gun Violence, Strong language, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fate has brought Dan to a town buried in the sands of the Old West. This place already has a different kind of life\u2014it's a life of crime, smuggling, and bootlegging. In the midst of the conflict between local gangs, Dan seems like someone who could solve long-standing problems. After all, he is the one who solves them with extreme violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/CAR_DESERT_3-N2.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the viscous sands of narrative and gameplay unraveling a tangle of interconnected events that will take you to a very different place than you expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tough top-down shooter inspired by Hotline Miami.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/paths_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_1.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" />Large levels with tactical freedom and adrenaline-pumping encounters. From luxury hotel penthouses to ancient temples. Everywhere you'll be challenged and you'll be sure to return the favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_2.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, hide, think. Die and think. And so every time on the way to your goal.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/C_ASSAULT_3.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/NARRATIVE_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This linear story may not be at all what it seems, depending on the depth you choose. Discover another side of the events that took place and shift your focus from a hardcore gangster thriller to something more special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/MESSENGER.gif?t=1747587414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/string2.png?t=1747587414\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 Large scale levels in individual locations, hand-designed without the use of neural networks and procedural generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Truly different weapons for your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Wild West town to explore, full of stories and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original rhythmic electronic soundtrack created by the composer.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Classified Office"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/421eba97fb7991108323101330ad5dc520f35820/header.jpg?t=1747587414","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"BOILED","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i3 1115<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GTX 660ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Classified Office"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/7a7f553b2a73c1037d73d0070defd5f8c2919