7414"}],"short_description":"America. 1925. Running an errand for an old friend inadvertently gets ex-gang leader Dan involved in a border town bootlegger\u2019s conflict. Adrenaline-pumping top-down shooter in the Wild West with an angry electronic soundtrack.","steam_appid":3474390,"support_info":{"email":"classifiedofficegeorgia@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}